<description>&lt;p&gt;Djibouti peacekeepers were killed and later repelled an attack by Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport, while U.S. airstrikes hit al-Shabab positions in three Somali locations. The United Arab Emirates has turned civilian airfields in Somaliland and Puntland into military bases, prompting Somalia to accuse the UAE of invasion and expel its ambassador. Al-Shabaab militants continue cross-border operations, abducting two Cuban doctors in Kenya and killing eight suspected militants in northeastern Kenya, while a Somali-American Uber driver was assaulted in Minnesota in a hate-crime incident. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdmF5V2FxNUNfQ1N4Z2RMRU1xYWYxUklnbjZEck5XQWlGRHhCTjdycFhVTExjSHFCVGhzdzlNTTFONUpKSFE5ZXdVdTBaX2R5OUdTME9fQ1AyWVpsaW9aLWxIcGg3SW9DRDlWVkw2QjFUbzF1ZEFmTjEzMmxka0NhUm15SGU4RVhJS1B4TFYxSTZqZGlUWVdFSHdaSDhhZVE2c2lzODRnTmktY3hnTVpHS2U4c2loNFhTb3BveVRYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNMm1OQmlZeElEaTFrdmQ3TjA0bElDLXhLa3JrbGxGdDZLRlZmd0dRZy0zVkdCZlBtMzQxQUVqU19QNGRvVExNR21peEE1SmpJZElBZDJoSkQzb3k2YTdsRGJwcmpTTzh5cW9vVGM2YUNFbHhsckU4akx0RFI1UlZJTkhkcmd4V2JhQnVWU2FLUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Barbados Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNNm5NZHkzakZlUG5jT3B6TkVmRElmcmY1VTdHc2tYbC1PRXNNdlNxMWEzR1FYWmZHd3BEOUNiS3VnYmJCcGZjUXRTdUhhOUE5ZlQwSmVHQ2RsWDRaSFRWYUhnSHU0R2hNNjVHUEdoWG5qTk5CZENvRnM2YlhoN2NfSlZEcVNXdkxMb2JxS01iTk9BMUdQMDE2NUUzY1BSMlFVa0JmbkpDWnh1cF90QmpZWmQ3YkVPVVIxZ05UYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUlpmeWd5aHZwdmFLYS15Rk9ZR0xZXzZ5N1RHQktYYjBIclNWZ3lkRGI4ZUpZajlzRjY3YzJTMEFRYUJMRTdkY3Z